; Human-owned policy for B2: what a program may request, and what each sink may receive.
; Sinks are deny-by-default. The two delivery services legitimately receive the recipient's personal data
; (name and address); the audit log accepts internal data only, so a name, email or phone number must never reach it.

(policy
  (allow net (connect "https://mail.example.com"))
  (allow net (connect "https://sms.example.com"))
  (allow audit)

  (sink net:email (accepts pii))
  (sink net:sms   (accepts pii))
  (sink audit     (accepts internal)))
